  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solomon Islands Education Sector Support Programme 19/20 - 24/25</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Solomon Islands Education Sector Support Programme&#xa0;is&#xa0;a joint investment by the New Zealand Ministry of Foreign Affairs and Trade (MFAT) and the Australian Department of Foreign Affairs and Trade (DFAT)&#xa0; to support the Solomon Islands Government (SIG) to implement its National Education Action Plan (NEAP). The combined investment will improve outcomes in basic education (Years 1-9) in the Solomon Islands from October 2019 to June 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
